I definitions.inc

# push：远程分支有本地历史之外的提交，非快进，报错
# 本地与远程各自在共同 initial 上独立前进
> init
<<<
+ a.txt mcur.txt
> add a.txt
<<<
> commit "local only"
<<<

C remote
> init
<<<
+ b.txt mgiven.txt
> add b.txt
<<<
> commit "remote only"
<<<
C
> add-remote origin remote/.gitlet
<<<

# 远程 head（remote only）不在本地 head 的祖先链上，拒绝
> push origin master
Please pull down remote changes before pushing.
<<<

# 远程 master 指针未被改动：远程 log 仍是 2 块且最新消息为 remote only
C remote
> log
${COMMIT_LOG}
${COMMIT_LOG}
<<<*
